 Multi-subscription extension for [pi](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono) -- use multiple OAuth accounts per provider with automatic rate-limit rotation and project-level affinity.
 
+The managed Earendil Pi package supports Anthropic, OpenAI Codex, and GitHub
+Copilot. Google Gemini CLI and Antigravity were removed from that Pi runtime;
+stale entries for those providers are ignored.
+
